menu "Mosaico Camera Service"

    config MOSAICO_CAMERA_EQUIVALENT_ROI
        bool "Use the equivalent SC101IOT preview window"
        depends on CAMERA_SC101IOT
        default y
        help
            Configure the current 1280x720 UYVY sensor mode to output only
            the 768x720 window consumed by Mosaic preview and photographs.
            Keeps the mode's clock, frame rate and image-processing registers.
            Other sensors and unrecognized modes retain their native format.
            Requires the GSP public Session trim and ownership-result APIs;
            the product checks this during configuration. GSP 1.9.0 provides
            the required public APIs.

endmenu
